text:
The Islamic Republic kills protesters and only returns the bodies if the families claim that their child was a Basij member who was killed by protesters!

And of course, they also take the "bullet money" from the families!
#IranProtests
@CNN
@POTUS
 @JDVance

@LauraLoomer

